title: "heav3ns-censor: Preservation-Aware Visual Dataset Curation, Contrastive False-Positive Suppression, and Deterministic Zero-Collateral Image Obscuration"
message: "If you use heav3ns-censor or its preservation-aware dataset curation, contrastive hard-negative grounding, SDF compositing, and multi-scale verification algorithms in your research or software, please cite it using the metadata below."
